    'Up to 500 events per call. action: view, search, export, print, modify, delete. purpose: claim_handling, medical_review, fraud_investigation, underwriting, customer_service, complaint, legal, audit, other. Send reason with "other" and case_ref with "fraud_investigation".': 'حتى 500 حدث في كل طلب. action: view, search, export, print, modify, delete. purpose: claim_handling, medical_review, fraud_investigation, underwriting, customer_service, complaint, legal, audit, other. أرسل reason مع "other" وcase_ref مع "fraud_investigation".',
